# 9. What the Graph Will Look Like

Example nodes:

```text
(:Vehicle {plate:"KA01AB1234"})
(:Camera {id:"cam_1"})
(:Camera {id:"cam_2"})
```

Relationships:

```text
(Vehicle)-[:SEEN_AT]->(Camera)
```

---

# 10. Example Graph Query

Inside Neo4j browser you can run:

```cypher
MATCH (v:Vehicle)-[:SEEN_AT]->(c:Camera)
RETURN v,c
```

This shows which vehicles were seen at which cameras.

---

# 11. Advanced Query Example

Find vehicles seen by **multiple cameras**.

```cypher
MATCH (v:Vehicle)-[:SEEN_AT]->(c:Camera)
RETURN v.plate, collect(c.id)
```

This reveals **vehicle movement patterns**.

